<!--
  The menu.

  Three bars, full width, evenly spaced, with the same stroke weight as the SDK's own
  icons. There is no cleverness available here and none wanted: the hamburger is the one
  glyph that needs no explanation anywhere, which is exactly why it earns the corner the
  gear used to have.

  Rectangles rather than strokes, so the weight is exact at any scale — a stroked path
  rounds differently on a matte panel.
-->
